# NOTICE — native Ghostty VT assets (H-13)

Hypa Agent Runtime loads a **pinned** shared library built from upstream
Ghostty (`libghostty-vt`) as the only pane VT.

## Ghostty / libghostty-vt

- Project: Ghostty (https://ghostty.org / https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty)
- Component: libghostty-vt (C API under `include/ghostty/vt.h`)
- Pin: see `native/ghostty/PIN.md` (commit SHA and Zig toolchain)
- License: MIT — full text in `native/ghostty/LICENSE.Ghostty`
