## Hypa packaging notes

- Hypa does not claim ownership of Ghostty.
- Native binaries under `native/runtimes/<rid>/native/libghostty-vt.*` are
  build products of the pinned source + Zig pin, not a third-party prebuilt
  of unknown provenance.
- Unix F1 and F2 pack `libghostty-vt`. Health is `vt.provider=ghostty`.
- `HYPA_VT_PROVIDER=basic` and `f1` are rejected. Missing native fails closed.
- Windows F1 has no Ghostty native and is not a Ghostty-only mux ship RID.
- An F2 pack (`hypa-f2-<rid>.tar.gz`) writes `hypa.channel` with token `f2`.
  F2 is the package floor plus recorded goldens. F1 already uses Ghostty.
- This NOTICE must ship with any distribute that includes `libghostty-vt`.
- An F2 distribute (`hypa-f2-<rid>.tar.gz`) must ship this NOTICE with `libghostty-vt`.

